			],
			"Message": "chore(Deps): Update Microsoft and Tauri submodules\n\nUpdate the Microsoft (VS Code fork) dependency to b2efa34451dfdb12f18b449a1c32e38224e16f40, bringing improvements to chat and agent features including:\n- Generalized model picker for Claude welcome chat\n- Parent session metadata for Copilot chat grouping\n- Agent session settings UI with filesystem provider\n- @github/copilot SDK updated to 1.0.34\n- Various bug fixes and performance improvements\n\nAlso update the Tauri submodule to c8b2c7a3ffc6e86491dba7264230d5e740d3eb73, pulling in the latest upstream Tauri fixes and improvements.\n\nRefs: Land/Dependency/Microsoft, Land/Dependency/Tauri",
			"SHA": "372b012ca561fc24ebfa338f31b61dcd20a061ef"
		},
